      "One of the biggest highlights of the trek is the hike to Tsergo Ri (4,984 m), one of the finest viewpoints in the Langtang region. From the summit, you will enjoy breathtaking panoramic views of Langtang Lirung (7,227 m), Dorje Lakpa, Gangchempo, Yala Peak, Naya Kanga, Ganchenpo, and several surrounding Himalayan peaks. You will also spend time exploring the beautiful village of Kyanjin Gompa, home to an ancient monastery, traditional yak cheese factory, and some of the most spectacular mountain views in Nepal.",
